    "question": "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-v/q6-question-1.svg\" alt=\"The figure below shows the plan of three identical circular cylinders of radius 6 cm , held together by an elastic band.\" style=\"--madas-width:549.3px\"></figure><figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-v/q6-question-2.svg\" alt=\"( ) Show that the exact length of the stretched elastic band is 12 π + 3 cm . ( ) 4\" style=\"--madas-width:573.3px\"></figure>",
