      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-v/q8-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"dy dt = 2 y dx dt = dx dy × dy dt dx dt = −x + 2y x + y × 2 y For y = 1, x2 + 2x −8 = (x + 4)(x −2) = 0; for y = −1, x2 −2x −8 = (x −4)(x + 2) . = 0 The four substitutions are (x, y) (−4, 1) (2, 1) (4, −1) (−2, −1) 8/3 . dx/dt −4/3 −8/3 4/3 The four possibilities are ±4/3, ±8/3 . [M1] [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
