    "question": "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-v/q10-question-1.svg\" alt=\"A curve is given parametrically by the equations = = θ ≤ &lt; x 4sin θ , y cos2 , 0 θ π . The tangent to the curve at the point P meets the x axis at the point ( ) 3,0 . ( ) 8 Determine the possible coordinates of P .\" style=\"--madas-width:604.0px\"></figure>",
